	"Description": "-REQUIREMENTS:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400]SMAPI\u00A0[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\n<br />[/list]\u00A0\n<br />-HOW TO INSTALL:\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Install\u00A0the latest version of SMAPI and Content Patcher.\n<br />[*]Extract \"[CP] cardo-de-comer's portraits\" into &#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Mods folder.\n<br />[*]Run the game using SMAPI.\n<br />\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[s][size=2]UPDATE 1.2: \n<br />Yes I know my style has changed. A lot, probably. I still wanna update the mod. \n<br />-Minor changes to some of the vanilla portraits. \n<br />-Changed mr.Qi and Sandy. \n<br />-Added a few of SVE characters.\n<br />[/size][size=5]\n<br />[/size][/s][size=5]Update 1.3. Idk how versions work.[/size][s][size=4]\n<br />[/size][/s][size=4]Finally updated the mod for 1.6.[/size][s][size=4] I[/size][/s][size=4] only briefly checked if the mod works so if there's something that isn't working please tell me, either here or on my tumblr.\n<br />[/size][size=4]I haven't completed SVE compatibility so i decided to fully delete it so there's no portraits for SVE[/size][size=4]. :( [/size][s][size=4]\n<br />\n<br />[/size][/s][size=4]2025 edit:[/size][s][size=4]\n<br />[/size][/s][size=4]I haven't touched this mod in years[/size][size=4] and[/size][size=4] i don't plan to[/size][size=4]. [/size][size=4]I don't have SV on my pc rn and I can't check if it works still, also I can't troubleshoot it.[/size][s][size=4]\n<br />[/size][/s]\n<br />\n<br />Special thanks to VelvetChaika for fixes and bear portrait. :з my artblog (tumblr) - [url=https://cardo-de-comer.tumblr.com/]cardo-de-comer.tumblr.com[/url]",
